need an account on there if you don't already have one. <a href=\"http://cardians.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Here's the link</a>. The games are played on roll20 with a Skype voice chat, so you'll need accounts for each of those, too (you probably already have those anyways).<br /> <br /> The game will use heavily-modded 2e rules and your character must be a Mortal that has never encountered the supernatural and knows nothing about it (they may be superstitious and/or religious though). The point being that a player's first session is a 1-on-1 Prelude that results in the character entering the Cardian Syndicate. <a href=\"http://livestre.am/4VRXz\" target=\"_blank\">Here was my character's</a> (pretty short, a little be over an hour and a half).<br /> <br /> Please keep in mind though that even if you are interested, you may not be accepted. This is because we, as STs, must select people who get along well with one another. To determine this, we hold meet &amp; greets. Again, I'll keep you posted if you're interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T15:51:17-07:00","id":595072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>crapcarp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/588172-in-boston-looking-for-nwod-group-or-online?p=593333#post593333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I'm setting up a HtV game with 2 other partners called Cardians: Vegas. The Cardian Syndicate is a custom Conspiracy with several divisions the world over, this particular game being, you guessed it, Las Vegas. Not exactly sure when we'll be ready, but I can keep you posted if you're interested.<br /> <br /> Cardians is a deviantART group, so you're gonna need an account on there if you don't already have one. <a href=\"http://cardians.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Here's the link</a>. The games are played on roll20 with a Skype voice chat, so you'll need accounts for each of those, too (you probably already have those anyways).<br /> <br /> The game will use heavily-modded 2e rules and your character must be a Mortal that has never encountered the supernatural and knows nothing about it (they may be superstitious and/or religious though). The point being that a player's first session is a 1-on-1 Prelude that results in the character entering the Cardian Syndicate. <a href=\"http://livestre.am/4VRXz\" target=\"_blank\">Here was my character's</a> (pretty short, a little be over an hour and a half).<br /> <br /> Please keep in mind though that even if you are interested, you may not be accepted. This is because we, as STs, must select people who get along well with one another. To determine this, we hold meet &amp; greets. Again, I'll keep you posted if you're interested.</div> </div> </div> </div>please do keep me in mind","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3642-lareath","name":"Lareath","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"186"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-21T15:12:31-07:00","id":598712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lareath</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/588172-in-boston-looking-for-nwod-group-or-online?p=595072#post595072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">please do keep me in mind</div> </div> </div> </div>Best thing to do is to watch the group on deviantART and apply for it. You'll see the apply link on the main journal (blog) there. You can apply for other groups as well, so if you don't get in Vegas perchance, you can try to join a different group instead. Keep in mind that different groups will use different rulesets, although all groups will have the same limitations on character creation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}